{
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph048": "Pick Up",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph015": "Foxtail Jump",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph006": "Grab",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w282": "In time trials, you receive \r\nrewards for your performance.\r\nKeep retrying them until \r\nyou get all the rewards.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph011": "Move Cereza",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph002": "Jump",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w165": "Inside the distortion, you will need \r\nto use your magic to dispel the \r\nillusion which shrouds the faeries with \r\n[BTN:L2 ], thus opening them up to attack.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w561": "When Colm has something to share\r\nwith you, a wisp mark will \r\nbe displayed on the map. \r\nBe careful not to miss it!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_g001": "The Costumes menu has been unlocked.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch029": "Slide",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w461": "Press [BTN:R1 ] with the\r\nright timing to have Cheshire \r\ncounter incoming attacks.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph044": "(Hold/Release) Multi-Bind",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w330": "You've destroyed the Stone \r\nElemental Core and received \r\nits power! Change Cheshire to \r\nhis stone form by pressing [BTN:B ].",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w323": "Note that elemental skills drain \r\nthe magic gauge. Keep watch of \r\nthe gauge above Cheshire's head \r\nand switch to Hug Mode to recover.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch021": "Revert",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch032": "Dodge",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w030": "The petals in the bottom left of \r\nthe screen are Cereza's vitality. \r\nThey will decrease when Cereza\r\nis attacked by the enemy.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w023": "The most advanced Witch Pulse\r\nof all. When you see a double circle,\r\nquickly tilt [BTN:LS ] in the \r\ncorrect direction two times!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w130": "Someone has left journal entries \r\nscattered through the forest. \r\nPick up any you find with [BTN:L1 ]\r\nto read them from the Archive.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph019": "Absorb Fire Power",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_d002": "Select a previously visited Sanctuary.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w430": "Interact with a Water Elemental \r\nsource to absorb its power \r\nand change the water-level \r\nof the surrounding area.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch025": "Counter",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w630": "Cheshire can now deliver a\r\nCharge Strike to finish off \r\nweakened enemies with [BTN:R2 ].",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph040": "Learn Skill",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w730": "By riding Cheshire and stabilising\r\nhim with her magic energy,\r\nCereza can now harness Cheshire's\r\nunbound demonic power!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch022": "Revert",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch031": "(Hold/Release) Bind Combo",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph047": "(Tilt Twice) Witch Pulse",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w333": "Stone Cheshire's stomp is able to\r\nuncover enemies burrowed in the \r\nground and send shockwaves that \r\nstun everything nearby. Try it out!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w320": "You've destroyed the Wood \r\nElemental Core and received \r\nits power! Change Cheshire to \r\nhis wood form by pressing [BTN:Y ].",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w120": "Large red arches are Sanctuaries\r\nthat can be unlocked just by\r\napproaching. Be sure to unlock\r\none whenever you pass by.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph009": "(Hold) Dance",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w020": "Cereza can use her Witch Pulse \r\nto grow Infernal plants. Hold [BTN:L2 ] \r\nand tilt [BTN:LS ] in the right \r\ndirection with the correct timing.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_d001": "Ignis can lead Cereza to Sanctuaries.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w024": "Witch Pulse is a fundamental\r\nUmbran Art that utilises dance\r\nto imbue its target with\r\nmagical energy.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w420": "No lake or stream can stand in \r\nWater Cheshire's way. Use [BTN:RS ]\r\nto have him swim gracefully\r\nalong the surface.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph050": "(Hold) Bind Next Enemy",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph043": "(Hold) Thorn Bind",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w720": "Time trials are where you get to\r\nrace against yourself for your\r\nbest completion time!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch026": "(Hold) Pull",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w171": "Find and destroy the core at\r\nthe heart of the Tír na nÓg. \r\nPress [BTN:START ] to open the menu if \r\nyou need to temporarily retreat.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph016": "Absorb Wood Power",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph005": "Go Up/Down Ladder",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph012": "(Hold) Thorn Bind",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph001": "(Near edge) Jump",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w281": "You can also challenge \r\nTír na nÓg time trials, racing\r\nfor the fastest completion \r\ntime possible.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w081": "When moving about together,\r\nyou can move Cereza with [BTN:LS ]\r\nand extend Cheshire with [BTN:RS ].",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w462": "Enemies hit with a counter\r\nwill be temporarily stunned.\r\nBut be warned - some attacks\r\ncannot be countered.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w100": "You can switch between moving \r\ntogether and moving apart at \r\nany time. Both have their uses,\r\nso don't forget either.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph029": "Destroy Core",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w000": "Cereza can check out a \r\nvariety of things with [BTN:L1 ].\r\nTry [BTN:L1 ] with anything \r\nthat catches your eye!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_e009": "...and start the concoction!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch011": "Swim",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch002": "(Tilt Towards Edge) Jump",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w300": "Choose a slot to save a record \r\nof your story. Auto-save has its\r\nown slot so you can keep some\r\nother saves of your liking.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w700": "Hold and release [BTN:R2 ] near a bound\r\nenemy to perform a powerful\r\ncombo attack. It packs quite \r\na punch so make use of it!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch015": "Stomp",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch006": "Move Cheshire",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w400": "Dodge with [BTN:L1 ] at the right timing \r\nto use Witch Time, temporarily allowing\r\nyou to move at extreme speeds. Use\r\nthis power to take Morgana down!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_b002": "Cheshire learns skills\r\nby using Avalon Drops.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph025": "Transform (Fire)",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph036": "Absorb Water Power",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w351": "Fire Cheshire can shoot \r\na Pyro Blast with [BTN:R1 ].\r\nThis attack may burn or melt\r\nobjects it hits.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_e005": "Here are some compounds.\r\nYou'll find more in the forest.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w051": "They cannot be far apart \r\nfor an extended period \r\nof time. Watch the distance \r\nbetween them.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch019": "Transform (Fire)",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_e012": "Use items you've made by holding [BTN:DP ].",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_e001": "You can now use concocting.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph032": "Unleashed Mode",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w900": "Jeanne can also use [BTN:L2 ] to perform \r\na Thorn Bind. Jeanne's version of \r\nthe spell has a massive area of effect \r\nand binds all enemies inside at once.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w751": "The locations of some Inferno Fruits\r\nare marked on your map.\r\nMore can be revealed by\r\ncompleting Tír na nÓg.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w651": "Using these Thorn Binds\r\nin succession, Cereza\r\nwill be able to bind two\r\nenemies at the same time.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_b006": "Cereza learns skills\r\nby using Onyx Roses.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph026": "(Hold) Thorn Vice",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph035": "Toss Wisp",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_b001": "Cheshire's skills are to the right.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_e006": "This is an item. Acquire one\r\nto learn how to concoct it.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w141": "Some of the wisps you'll find\r\nare troubled. If you help them\r\nsolve their problems, good\r\nthings could happen for you!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w441": "Each type of barrier has its\r\nown weakness. A strong\r\nblast should be effective\r\nagainst stone barriers.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_e011": "Success!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_e002": "Select \"Concoct\" from the menu.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_b005": "Cereza's skills are to the left.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph022": "Transform (Wood)",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph031": "Extend Cheshire",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w910": "Her spell has a long cooldown \r\nafter each cast, but when used \r\nagainst a large group the results \r\ncan be devastating.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w752": "Items Cereza can use to learn \r\nnew skills are also hidden \r\nin the forest. Make sure to \r\ncheck your map and find them all!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w010": "Check lanterns along your journey\r\nusing [BTN:L1 ] to save your progress.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph039": "Dispel Illusion",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w310": "Press [BTN:L1 ] to absorb elemental\r\npower found within the forest\r\ninto Cereza's magic brace.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch012": "Aquastream",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch001": "Attack",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch016": "Transform (Wood)",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch005": "Slash",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w710": "Use items with [BTN:DP ]: they can\r\nreally change the flow of battle,\r\nso be sure to not just let\r\nthem pile up!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w510": "Try guiding the wisps through \r\nthe Tír na nÓg. Be careful, if \r\nthey get hit, they are done for.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_f001": "The Tír na nÓg menu has been unlocked.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w410": "After certain enemy attacks, a mark\r\nwill appear above their head - this\r\nis your chance to use [BTN:L2 ]\r\nand perform a more powerful bind.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph023": "Transform (Stone)",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph030": "Move Cereza",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w740": "Cereza does not yet have the\r\npowers to defeat an enemy on her\r\nown. Use your Umbran Arts to\r\nbind enemies and proceed forward.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w640": "Hold and release [BTN:R2 ] to use\r\na Charge Strike after Cereza has\r\nbound an enemy, and Cheshire will\r\nperform a powerful combo attack.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_b004": "Then press and hold \r\nto learn the skill.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w440": "Some faeries have elemental \r\nbarriers. When their barrier \r\nis up, most attacks won't \r\nwork on them.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch008": "(Hold) Pull",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_e010": "After adding the compounds,\r\nmix everything together!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_e003": "Let's try making an item!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w140": "Wisps can be found throughout\r\nAvalon, trapped by faeries. \r\nPress [BTN:L1 ] to save\r\nthem when you find them.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w040": "The demon's sharp claws and\r\nfangs make short work of \r\nfaeries. Scratch with [BTN:R2 ]\r\nand show your Infernal might!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_e007": "Let's try making a Healing Tonic.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_b000": "Here Cereza and Cheshire can learn new skills.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph027": "(Hold) Dance",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph034": "Hold Wisp",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w340": "You've destroyed the Water \r\nElemental Core and received \r\nits power! Change Cheshire to \r\nhis water form by pressing [BTN:X ].",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w411": "Thorn Vice is able to hold enemies \r\nfor longer, and enemies will take \r\nmore damage while bound. See \r\nwhat this new power is capable of!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w511": "Wisps are very weak.\r\nThey cannot survive\r\nany attacks whatsoever. \r\nGuide them with care!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch017": "Transform (Stone)",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch004": "Counter",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch013": "Aquastream",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch000": "Move",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w311": "Once enough power has been\r\nabsorbed in the magic brace,\r\nyour magic gauge will increase.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w102": "Hug Mode is where you move \r\ntogether. Press [BTN:L1 ] to revert \r\nCheshire to a stuffed animal.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph038": "Destroy Elemental Core",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w011": "The game will be saved\r\nautomatically at different moments\r\nin the story. Watch for this icon\r\nin the bottom right of the screen.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch014": "Pyro Blast",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch007": "Slash",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_e008": "Select how many you'd\r\nlike to make...",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch010": "Stomp",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch003": "Jump",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w101": "Unleashed Mode is where\r\nyou move the two separately. \r\nPress [BTN:R1 ] when holding \r\nCheshire to have him jump out.\r\n",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph028": "(Tilt) Witch Pulse",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w650": "Cereza's Spell Cooldown gauge\r\nhas increased, allowing her \r\nto cast two Thorn Binds in a row!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_b007": "Try out lots of different skills!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph020": "(Rotate) Restoration Magic",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph033": "Hug Mode",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w750": "Devouring Inferno Fruits \r\nallows Cheshire to learn \r\npowerful new skills.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w550": "If lost, look to the guiding lights.\r\nThey will lead Cereza\r\nto a nearby Sanctuary.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w450": "In Hug Mode, the magic\r\ngauge will replenish\r\ngradually. Switch modes\r\nwhen running low.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch018": "Transform (Water)",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_e013": "Check what you can make with [BTN:Y ].",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_e004": "This is the Concocting menu.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w050": "Cereza and Cheshire can\r\nmove about separately.\r\nMove Cereza with [BTN:LS ],\r\nand move Cheshire with [BTN:RS ].",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph024": "Transform (Water)",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph037": "Hug Mode (Recover Magic)",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w343": "Water Cheshire can use his\r\nAquastream ability with [BTN:R1].\r\nThis ability has great reach and power,\r\nso try using it in lots of places.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w350": "You've destroyed the Fire \r\nElemental Core and received \r\nits power! Change Cheshire to \r\nhis fire form by pressing [BTN:A ].",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_b003": "Move your cursor to the skill\r\nyou'd like to learn...",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch027": "Move Left/Right",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph042": "Dodge",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w732": "He can also use [BTN:A ][BTN:B ][BTN:X ][BTN:Y ]\r\nto perform powerful elemental\r\nattacks! Use these powers to \r\nturn the tables in your favour!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w721": "The clock begins when you cross\r\nthe green line or at the start of\r\nbattle. Reach the finish to earn\r\na reward based on your clear time.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w325": "Press [BTN:Y ] to revert \r\nCheshire to his regular form.\r\nRemember Cheshire can only\r\ncounter attacks in this form.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w125": "Tracks left by the white wolf.\r\nFollowing them might\r\nhelp lead the way.\r\nCheck nearby for more!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w025": "These Infernal plants are bigger \r\nthan Morgana's herbs. They will \r\nrequire more magic from Witch \r\nPulse to reach their full size.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w421": "Cheshire can only swim in his \r\nwater form. Jump in for a dip \r\nin any other form and he will\r\nautomatically switch to Water.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph008": "(Tilt) Witch Pulse",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph046": "(Tilt/Hold) Witch Pulse",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w332": "Stone Cheshire's hard\r\nexterior can deflect\r\nmost attacks, but will\r\nuse magic when doing so.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w321": "Wood Cheshire can use a wood \r\nattack with [BTN:R2 ]. Its massive\r\npower should give you some leverage\r\nin battle, so be sure to use it!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch023": "Revert",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch030": "(Hold/Release) Chomp!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w080": "When in his stuffed animal \r\nform, Cereza can hold Cheshire \r\nand move with him.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w670": "The white wolf's footprint on\r\nthe map represents where Ignis \r\nsuggests you should go next.\r\nUse it when feeling lost.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w280": "After completion, Tír na nÓgs can \r\nbe retried from Sanctuaries. \r\nGo back and collect any treasure \r\nyou forgot!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph013": "Toss Cheshire",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph000": "Move",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph017": "Absorb Stone Power",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph004": "(Holding [BTN:L1 ]) Push/pull box",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w270": "Ignis can guide Cereza to \r\nSanctuaries across the forest. \r\nReturn to one and you \r\nmight find something new.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w680": "When far away or blocked by rosemary, \r\nthere are times Cheshire cannot return \r\nto Hug Mode. When this happens, \r\nlook for another way to unite the two.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w480": "Giant mushrooms can be \r\nstomped by Stone Cheshire \r\nto launch you high into the air.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w070": "Hold [BTN:L2 ] to summon Infernal\r\nthorns that can bind enemies.\r\nDoing so will cost one \r\nSpell Cooldown gauge.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w170": "Tír na nÓg are the source of the\r\nfaeries' illusions. They can be found\r\nspread throughout the forest.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w090": "In Hug Mode, Cheshire can be \r\ntossed to certain high places \r\nwith [BTN:L1 ]. Search high and low\r\nto find a new way forward!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch028": "Jump",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w460": "Besides decimating enemies\r\nwith his claws and fangs, \r\nCheshire can counter their \r\nattacks as well.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w560": "After you've helped a few wisps, \r\ngo see Colm at the Wisps' Hideaway.\r\nHe may have a gift for you.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph010": "(Tilt) Witch Pulse",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph003": "Draw Water",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w390": "Rotate [BTN:LS ] while holding [BTN:L2 ]  \r\nnear broken objects to temporarily \r\nreturn them to their original form \r\nwith Cereza's Restoration Magic.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w660": "Some flying enemies are very\r\nweak and can be defeated with \r\nonly a Thorn Bind. ",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w260": "In the Costumes menu, you can\r\nchange Cereza and Cheshire's\r\noutfits for the journey. Drop by\r\nto spice things up sometimes.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w690": "Have Cheshire slam into the\r\npillars and then try and calm \r\nhim. Use Restoration Magic\r\nif the pillars happen to crumble.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph014": "Extend Cheshire",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph007": "(Hold) Dance",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w160": "The distortion created by faeries\r\nis full of illusions. Use your magic \r\nwith [BTN:L2 ] to dispel the illusions \r\nand see through their deceptions.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph049": "(Hold) Bind First Enemy",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w490": "The Elemental Cores in each \r\nshrine can be destroyed by \r\nCheshire's attacks.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w060": "Being a demon, Cheshire can't \r\nstand rosemary. Whenever it \r\npops up, Cheshire will need \r\nto take a different path.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph041": "(Hold) Thorn Bind",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w731": "Unbound Cheshire can evade \r\nwith [BTN:L1 ] and use a powerful \r\nphysical attack using [BTN:R1 ].",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w722": "Clocks you collect will decrease\r\nyour time, while any damage you\r\ntake will add to it, so take care.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w326": "Changing back to Wood Cheshire\r\nis also [BTN:Y]. You can check \r\nyour current element in the \r\nbottom right of the screen.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch024": "Revert",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_d003": "Ignis recommends going here next.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w026": "Keep holding [BTN:L2 ] until \r\nWitch Pulse has succeeded\r\nmultiple times. Be sure not \r\nto let go midway!",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph018": "Absorb Water Power",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w031": "If Cereza's vitality runs out, her \r\nstory will come to an end. \r\nKeep a close eye on her \r\nremaining vitality at all times.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w022": "Try an advanced Witch Pulse! \r\nAs Cereza dances, tilt and hold \r\n[BTN:LS ] while the marker travels\r\nacross the stretched red line.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ch020": "Aquastream",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_ph045": "(Hold) Thorn Bind",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w331": "Stone Cheshire can perform\r\na powerful stomp with [BTN:R1 ]\r\nthat can smash, pop up, or flip\r\nover certain objects.",
  "TUT_TUTORIAL_TEXT_w322": "Wood Cheshire can also extend \r\nhis tongue and grab objects \r\nwith [BTN:R1 ]. Hold [BTN:R1 ] while \r\ngrabbing an object to drag it."
}
